    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy - reachability</span><span class=\"chip\">Implicit BFS</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/jump-game-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 45</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Jump Game II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Treat it as BFS on a line: the indices reachable with k jumps form one contiguous block, and the next block ends at the farthest i + nums[i] seen inside the current one. Scan once, count a jump each time you pass the end of a block. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
